            {
                "date": "2021-09-24",
                "text": "If an effect instructs you to \"double\" a creature's power, that creature gets +X/+0, where X is its power as that effect begins to apply. Similarly, a creature whose toughness is doubled gets +0/+X, where X is its toughness as the effect begins to apply."
